      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delphos%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The 274‑mile Miami and Erie Canal cut through Delphos, turning the town into a bustling canal port linked to railroads.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
